      "label": "Truthful archive record note",
      "offset": 60898,
      "before": " \"V38 completed two separately granted disjoint selected batches on014062: four new groups and all original63 in the retained order. \"\n \"Each has independently accepted fresh BuildQuery metadata and strict positive runtime with exact original evidence. \"\n \"Observed metadata totals are recorded per cohort, not inferred from source declarations or transferred to another head. \"\n \"The initial catalog schema failure and original new4 positive-auditor provenance failure remain separately preserved non-native attempts; \"\n \"the accepted new4 runtime is the unchanged original run, not a rerun. \"\n \"All prior history and the complete old checkpoint are retained. This proposal changes only progress and adds immutable evidence. \"\n \"Application qualification, bridge removal, publication and new source/native authority remain false.\")",
      "after": " \"V38 retains separately accepted fresh BuildQuery metadata for new4(61) and original63(1285) on014062. \"\n \"The unchanged original new4 strict runtime is accepted. Original63 first had a zero-native prelaunch freshness rejection, \"\n \"then a closed strict partial native failure:17 of63 groups ran,321 tests completed,320 passed, one failed, and964 tests in46 groups were unstarted. \"\n \"The first16 group results remain partial_batch_not_admissible, not independently accepted. \"\n \"Seven observed attempts are appended, including three non-native negatives; only the actual partial native failure extends native-negative history. \"\n \"All original catalog/auditor/helper/preparer/static evidence and the complete old checkpoint are retained; inspection-only negatives add no validation attempts. \"\n \"Metadata is recorded per original cohort and never transferred to another head. This proposal changes only progress and adds immutable evidence. \"\n \"Application qualification, bridge removal, publication and new source/native authority remain false.\")",
